   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\n  <li>The cost for an upcoming field trip is $15 per student. The cost of the field trip <span data-math=\"C\">C</span>, in dollars, is a function of the number of students <span data-math=\"x\">x</span>. <strong>Select two</strong> possible outputs for the function defined by <span data-math=\"C(x)=15x\">C(x)=15x</span>.</li>\n</ol>\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"a\">\n  <li>20</li>\n  <li>30</li>\n  <li>50</li>\n  <li>90</li>\n  <li>100</li>\n</ol>",
